<title>RUSSIA: Russia Promstroibank to issue Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Russia Promstroibank to issue Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of Russia's biggest banks, Promyshlenno-Stroitelny Bank (Peterburg) (Promstroibank St Petersburg)plans to raise $50-$100 million from a Eurobond issue in 1997, its chairman David Traktovenko said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He did not give any other details of the terms of the issue.</p>
</text>
